{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810680/extras/65a19e6d7acd276f3c89335a2aeb0cfa.poster.avif?t=1769034812\" width=780 height=134 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810680/extras/65a19e6d7acd276f3c89335a2aeb0cfa.webm?t=1769034812\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810680/extras/65a19e6d7acd276f3c89335a2aeb0cfa.mp4?t=1769034812\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Sweet Spot is a cozy horror game set in the 1980s that puts you in the role of Jessica, a 27-year-old woman who has just been hired to work the last shift at an ice cream shop located in the middle of a highway. It's a relaxing job, but not always...</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Make Delicious Ice Cream:</strong> Prepare delicious ice creams and milkshakes in different flavors with quick and easy recipes.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810680/extras/113ec68f89c2fe4578a659cd6a4e9a0a.poster.avif?t=1769034812\" width=780 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810680/extras/113ec68f89c2fe4578a659cd6a4e9a0a.webm?t=1769034812\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810680/extras/113ec68f89c2fe4578a659cd6a4e9a0a.mp4?t=1769034812\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Serve Customers:</strong> Serve a variety of customers with different tastes. Your goal is to make them happy!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810680/extras/a910ef38d4ffb9796c9d4ba46a3cfe7d.poster.avif?t=1769034812\" width=780 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810680/extras/a910ef38d4ffb9796c9d4ba46a3cfe7d.webm?t=1769034812\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810680/extras/a910ef38d4ffb9796c9d4ba46a3cfe7d.mp4?t=1769034812\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Psychological Horror:</strong> Making ice cream can be relaxing, but be careful, you may not be alone.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810680/extras/adce070174d58786195a5a0db185a70c.poster.avif?t=1769034812\" width=780 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810680/extras/adce070174d58786195a5a0db185a70c.webm?t=1769034812\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810680/extras/adce070174d58786195a5a0db185a70c.mp4?t=1769034812\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>VHS Aesthetic:</strong> VHS filter emulates the look of old movies and adds a nostalgic and spooky atmosphere.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Autosave:</strong> Autosave at the end of each work day.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Modes</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Story Mode:</strong> Game mode that tells the disturbing story of Jessica's first week of work at The Sweet Spot. Lasts approximately 1 hour.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Endless Mode:</strong> Game mode with endless work hours and a time limit to deliver each order. Survive as long as you can.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Relax Mode:</strong> Same as Endless Mode, but with no time limit to deliver each order. Relax by making ice cream while listening to music.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3810680?t=1769034812","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810680/30fc05d6eccda8630aa9f1b600c138b909d25ed5/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1769034812","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810680/806a227802c82ec3374f89a08dfae519dbe3342b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1769034812","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810680/806a227802c82ec3374f89a08dfae519dbe3342b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1769034812","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"This game may contain content not appropriate for all ages, or may not be appropriate for viewing at work: General Mature Content"},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3915340,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810680/extras/65a19e6d7acd276f3c89335a2aeb0cfa.poster.avif?t